# Files that searches (ripgrep, and the agents' search tools built on it) skip. Each one repeats text that lives in
# src/, so a search would print every match twice, and their lines run to tens of thousands of characters.
#   index.html      src/ joined by tools/build.mjs; edit src/, never this
#   _v_late6.html   an old snapshot of the page, kept since build 191
# To search them anyway: rg --no-ignore PATTERN index.html
index.html
_v_late6.html
